messages "Atreyu**Subj: spellbookCc: onarionDate: Sep  1Hello,I think I have an idea that can be very useful and it is about thespellbook.At the moment when you merge a spell it is added to the end of thespellbook which is really nice. But it can be even nicer when thespells in the spellbook are sorted in some way. And I can think oftwo ways that can be useful:For instance, you can sort the spells in alphabetical order on thename of the spell .. likeabcrabacracarbaetc..Or you can sort them, in alphabetical order on the last spellword likeexs brr bltexs fla bltexs sol bltexs zzt bltexs brr zumetc..That last way has the advantage that you can see very fast which spellsare still missing in the spellbookThe other has the advantage that if some sells a scroll that you cansee very fast if you already have that scroll in your spellbook.having a sorted order in any case will help.THank you, atreyu**"
